{"repositoryId":1380033419,"availability":"available","full":"Sarvamm/Zeno-2","name":"Zeno-2","description":"Zeno 2 is a data analysis platform powered by LLMs. Talk to your data in natural language, get interactive visualizations, run commands directly and export notebook when you're done.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-21T15:36:35Z","updated":"2026-10-13T13:38:33Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://zeno-2.streamlit.app/","topics":["data-analysis","data-visualization","langchain","natural-language-processing","streamlit"],"demo":"https://zeno-2.streamlit.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:49.938Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:49.938Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:49.938Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T02:47:49.938Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Zeno 2 is an intelligent, conversational data analysis platform built with Streamlit, LangChain, and an isolated Jupyter Kernel background runtime. By bridging open-source 120B LLMs hosted on Groq with live stateful execution and automated data profiling, Zeno 2 allows users to explore datasets through natural language queries, direct Python commands, and interactive visual outputs."],"features":["Automated Data Profiling (sinica): Instant data summaries, schema detection, and automated data alert generation upon file upload using the custom sinica library.","Stateful Jupyter Kernel Runtime: Background kernel managed via jupyterclient maintains full in-memory execution context (DataFrames, variables, plots, and models) across conversation turns.","Context-Aware LLM Agent: Powered by OSS 120B models via Groq API and LangChain. The agent inspects kernel variable memory manifests and schema metadata to write precise, context-accurate executable code.","Interactive Chat Interface: Renders streamed code responses, execution logs, formatted tables, and interactive Plotly visualizations directly inside Streamlit.","Direct Kernel Commands (/ Slash Mode): Bypass the LLM to execute raw Python code directly inside the active Jupyter kernel space (e.g., / df.describe())."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sarvamm/Zeno-2/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"209177a0904351cacc6ac812cf9ff6f98df1aeaf8b9887675829946d537046cb","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:50.020Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:50.020Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Zeno 2 is an intelligent, conversational data analysis platform built with Streamlit, LangChain, and an isolated Jupyter Kernel background runtime. By bridging open-source 120B LLMs hosted on Groq with live stateful execution and automated data profiling, Zeno 2 allows users to explore datasets through natural language queries, direct Python commands, and interactive visual outputs.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sarvamm/Zeno-2/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Create a .env file or configure Streamlit secrets (.streamlit/secrets.toml) with your Groq API Key:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sarvamm/Zeno-2/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"209177a0904351cacc6ac812cf9ff6f98df1aeaf8b9887675829946d537046cb","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sarvamm/Zeno-2/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:50.021Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-13T13:38:33Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sarvamm/Zeno-2/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:50.022Z","hash":"209177a0904351cacc6ac812cf9ff6f98df1aeaf8b9887675829946d537046cb","originalBytes":8356,"storedBytes":8356,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["kernel","data","streamlit","groq","api","llm","jupyter","python","sinica","code","direct","key","plotly","profiling","agent","bash","environment","execution","interactive","ipykernel","analysis","automated","chat","class","clas